	(text "STM32 RC-car controller Rev C\nBattery 2S-3S XT30 -> reverse protection -> 5 V/3 A buck (servos, receiver) + DRV8870 brushed motor driver\n4 servo/ESC outputs, 3 receiver inputs, 2 light outputs, LSM6DS3TR-C IMU, USB-C, Cortex-Debug, Qwiic, UART\nSTM32F103C8T6, 8 MHz HSE, 4 layers, JLCPCB assembly (LCSC field on every part)"
